; matmul.uft — text encoding (v11): 128x128 C=A*B, checksum=2863136768
fi:
  row! 128 'fe for ret
fe:
  col! row@ 128 * col@ + ix!
  ^A@ ix@ row@ col@ + set
  ^B@ ix@ row@ col@ - set ret
cr:
  row! 128 'dc for ret
dc:
  col! 0 acc! 128 'ij for
  ^C@ row@ 128 * col@ + acc@ set ret
ij:
  j! ^A@ row@ 128 * j@ + get
  ^B@ j@ 128 * col@ + get
  * acc@ + acc! ret
se:
  ^C@ swp get ^sum@ + ^sum! ret
entry:
  16384 arr int ^A! 16384 arr int ^B! 16384 arr int ^C!
  128 'fi for
  128 'cr for
  0 ^sum!
  16384 'se for
  ^sum@ "checksum=%d\n" print
